Honor FINDSTR /B, /E and /X when matching plain text on a short line.
At 4fbbefd614b argument parsing records the flags but find_str uses
strstr unconditionally. Windows /X red does not match tired; /E red
does match redred. This does not add regular expressions, multi-pattern
matching or whole-line buffering for long input.
The installed x64 Hyper-V build matched one of seven ordinary-word cases;
this candidate matched all seven, including /V and the not-found exit code.

